WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.340
- I'd love to go deeper.

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.460
Would you be willing to let
me analyze you a bit more?

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.530
- Oh, listen, if you're
willing to go in here.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:07.820
- I'm ready.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.363
- Listen, you don't wanna get in here.

00:00:10.363 --> 00:00:11.400
- I'm ready.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.410
I'm not afraid.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.021
Let's step into my office.

00:00:14.021 --> 00:00:15.207
Let's do it.

00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:16.207
Let's do it.

00:00:17.474 --> 00:00:18.720
Okay.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.523
You are obviously on the couch.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.184
I mean, your legs are gonna
be really high in this seat.

00:00:26.184 --> 00:00:27.190
(laughing)

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.326
It's a very high seat.

00:00:29.326 --> 00:00:30.389
- Let's see.

00:00:30.389 --> 00:00:31.420
- Is that how they are?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.980
Yeah, I would fall asleep in therapy

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.140
if this is what it looked like.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.250
- I actually.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.940
- They'd be like open up
and I'd be like (snoring).

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.670
(laughing)

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.115
- You sure this is a trip
you wanna take, sister?

00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:44.000
- Yes.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.210
Yes, brother, let's do it.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.073
Okay, so when was the last
time you really cried?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.608
- I'm crying inside right now.

00:00:51.608 --> 00:00:54.490
- Oh, so you're
uncomfortable around people,

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:56.090
okay, okay, okay.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:59.230
What's the one thing in life
you're still trying to find?

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.409
- My hair.

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:02.659
(laughing)

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.155
I swear.

00:01:08.155 --> 00:01:10.304
- Here, you can borrow mine.

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:12.316
- I went to bed one night.

00:01:12.316 --> 00:01:13.704
- You can borrow mine.

00:01:13.704 --> 00:01:15.458
- Thank you.

00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.708
(laughing)

00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:21.846
- I found this lovely little piece.

00:01:21.846 --> 00:01:23.066
You look beautiful.

00:01:23.066 --> 00:01:23.899
- Thank you.

00:01:23.899 --> 00:01:24.732
- You look beautiful.

00:01:24.732 --> 00:01:26.200
Anyone can have hair.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.850
What is the one thing--

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:28.870
- I went to bed one
night and it was there.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.240
And I woke up the next
morning and it was gone.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.089
- Me too!

00:01:32.089 --> 00:01:33.472
That's why I'm wearin' weave, brother!

00:01:33.472 --> 00:01:34.588
(laughing)

00:01:34.588 --> 00:01:35.421
It's gettin' thin.

00:01:35.421 --> 00:01:37.052
- I swear I've been bald since I was 12.

00:01:37.052 --> 00:01:38.350
(laughing)

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.360
- That's all right.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.885
It's tough, I like it.

00:01:40.885 --> 00:01:41.718
Tough doctor.

00:01:41.718 --> 00:01:45.710
- I read one time that 78% of
men would amputate a body part

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:46.780
rather than be bald.

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:48.224
- I know one they wouldn't.

00:01:48.224 --> 00:01:49.828
(laughing)

